# 8️⃣ Rotten Oranges

## Problem

Cells:

```text
0 → Empty

1 → Fresh Orange

2 → Rotten Orange
```

Every minute:

```text
Rotten Orange
infects adjacent Fresh Orange
```

Find:

```text
Minimum Time
```

to rot all oranges.

